   <taskbody>
      <context>
         <p>The SMS mobile app stores important information about different operations of the app. If you run into an issue, you can download these logs and share them with your IT team for investigation. The logs are downloaded as a zip file and contain a maximum of 20MB of data.</p>
         <p>To export logs:</p>
      </context>
      <steps id="steps_103141176">
         <step>
            <cmd>Log in to the SMS mobile application.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Tap Settings on the bottom menu.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Tap Export Logs.</cmd>
         </step>
      </steps>
      <result>
         <p>
